Three items Misho approved word for word in his own chat:

- 0266 part 2 (the tester's 58043, run 51408): the search guidance now
  says that two people holding two different offices (a group's CEO
  and its subsidiary's) are not two names for one office; each is named
  with their exact title and the page. TBC's group and bank CEOs had
  been read as a conflict and answered with „could not verify".
- The tester's 58416: the day's contact question names the contact as
  the owner saved them, with the number's last two digits („…
  (ნომერი მთავრდება 47-ზე)"), so the owner can tell who is meant.
- FOR_FRONTEND: the exact text replacing the 5-day trial on the Terms
  and Refund pages.

(3671's sentence went live through the prompt route, not this patch.)

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
